---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact Us - FinCompute">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-sm text-body leading-relaxed space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-1.6px] text-ink mb-8">Contact Us.</h1>

    <p>
      Have a question, suggestion, or need to report an issue with one of our calculators? We'd love to hear from you.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-ink mt-8">Email</h2>
    <p>
      You can reach us directly at <a href="mailto:hello@fincompute.com" class="text-link hover:underline">hello@fincompute.com</a>. We aim to respond within a few business days.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-ink mt-8">Bug Reports</h2>
    <p>
      If you've found a calculation error or a bug, please include the following in your message so we can investigate quickly:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
      <li>The calculator you were using</li>
      <li>The input values you entered</li>
      <li>The result you expected vs. what you received</li>
      <li>Your browser and device (optional but helpful)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-ink mt-8">Feature Requests</h2>
    <p>
      Want to see a new calculator or an improvement to an existing one? Send us a description of what you're looking for and we'll consider it for future updates.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.6px] text-ink mt-8">Partnerships</h2>
    <p>
      For business inquiries or partnership opportunities, reach out to <a href="mailto:hello@fincompute.com" class="text-link hover:underline">hello@fincompute.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
